"<guimenuitem>Restart Game</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycap>F5</keycap></shortcut> <guimenu>खेल</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>खेलं पुनः आरभत</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:143
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Starts a new game with the same settings as the current game."
msgstr "वर्तमानक्रीडायाः समानसेटिंग्स् इत्यनेन नूतनं क्रीडां आरभते ।"

#: index.docbook:146
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Show High Scores…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>H</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>उच्चाङ्कान् दर्शयतु…</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:149
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Displays</action> the high score table."
msgstr "<action>उच्चाङ्कसारणीं प्रदर्शयति</action> ।"

#: index.docbook:152
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>Q</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>Game</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Quit</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut><keycombo "
"action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>प्रश्न</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> "
"<guimenu>खेल</guimenu> <guimenuitem>निवृत्तं</guimenuitem>"

#: index.docbook:155
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<action>Quits</action> &ksquares;."
msgstr "<action>त्यजति</action> &ksquares;."

#: index.docbook:158
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Settings</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Configure &ksquares;…</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> <guimenuitem>&ksquares;…</guimenuitem> "
"विन्यस्यताम्"

#: index.docbook:161
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<action>Opens a dialog to configure &ksquares;.</action> See <link "
"linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for details."
msgstr ""
"<action>&amp;ksquares;विन्यस्तुं संवादं उद्घाटयति ।</action> पश्यतु<link "
"linkend=\"configuration\"> खेल विन्यास</link> विस्तरेण कृते विभागः।"

#: index.docbook:165
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Additionally &ksquares; has the common &kde; <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"and <guimenu>Help</guimenu> menu items, for more information read the "
"sections about the <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">Settings Menu</ulink> "
"and <ulink url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-help\">Help "
"Menu</ulink> of the &kde; Fundamentals."
msgstr ""
"अतिरिक्तरूपेण &ksquares; सामान्यं &kde; <guimenu>सेटिंग्स्</guimenu> तथा "
"<guimenu>सहायता</guimenu> मेनू-वस्तूनाम्, अधिकसूचनार्थं <ulink "
"url=\"help:/fundamentals/menus.html#menus-settings\">सेटिंग्स् मेन्यू< "
"इत्यस्य विषये विभागान् पठन्तु /ulink> तथा च &kde; मौलिकता।"

#: index.docbook:175
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "बहुधा पृष्टाः प्रश्नाः"

#: index.docbook:180
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr "अहम् अस्य क्रीडायाः स्वरूपं परिवर्तयितुम् इच्छामि। अहं शक्नोमि ?"

#: index.docbook:181
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Currently the only thing you can change about the game look is the color of "
"the lines. To do so use the <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &ksquares;…</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu item. "
"See <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</link> section for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"सम्प्रति भवन्तः क्रीडायाः रूपस्य विषये केवलं रेखानां वर्णः एव परिवर्तयितुं "
"शक्नुवन्ति । तदर्थं प्रयोजयन्तु<menuchoice><guimenu> "
"सेटिंग्स्</guimenu><guimenuitem> &amp;ksquares;… विन्यस्तं "
"कुर्वन्तु।</guimenuitem></menuchoice> मेनू मद। पश्यतु<link "
"linkend=\"configuration\"> खेल विन्यास</link> विस्तरेण कृते विभागः।"

#: index.docbook:184
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr "मया त्रुटिः कृता। अहं पूर्ववत् कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

#: index.docbook:185
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &ksquares; doesn't currently have an <quote>Undo</quote> feature."
msgstr "सं.&ksquares; सम्प्रति <quote>Undo</quote> इति विशेषता नास्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:188
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use the keyboard to play the game?"
msgstr "क्रीडां कर्तुं कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगं कर्तुं शक्नोमि वा?"

#: index.docbook:189
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. &ksquares; cannot be played using keyboard."
msgstr "सं.&ksquares; कीबोर्डस्य उपयोगेन वादयितुं न शक्यते।"

#: index.docbook:192
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr "अत्र किं कर्तव्यमिति चिन्तयितुं न शक्नोमि! किं संकेताः सन्ति ?"

#: index.docbook:193
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "No. There is no <quote>Hint</quote> feature implemented yet."
msgstr "न ।अद्यापि <quote>Hint</quote> इति विशेषता कार्यान्वितं नास्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:196
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""
"इदानीं मया क्रीडां त्यक्तव्या, परन्तु अहम् अद्यापि न समाप्तः। अहं मम "
"प्रगतिम् रक्षितुं शक्नोमि वा ?"

#: index.docbook:197
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "&ksquares; does not have a <quote>Save</quote> feature."
msgstr "&ksquares; <quote>रक्षतु</quote> इति विशेषता नास्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:204
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Configuration"
msgstr "गेम विन्यास"

#: index.docbook:206
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Game Dialog"
msgstr "नवीनः क्रीडासंवादः"

#: index.docbook:213
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "New game"
msgstr "नवीनः क्रीडा"

#: index.docbook:217
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>New Game</guilabel> dialog consistes of the following "
"groupboxes:"
msgstr "<guilabel>नवीनक्रीडा</guilabel> संवादे निम्नलिखितसमूहपेटिकाः सन्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:220
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Players"
msgstr "क्रीडकाः"

#: index.docbook:221
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can change the number of participating players, as well as "
"determine who will be played by human and who by the artificial "
"intelligence. Use the <guilabel>Number of players:</guilabel> spin-box to "
"specify the number of participants. Then type a name for each participant "
"and use the <guilabel>Human?</guilabel> check box to specify the player "
"type."
msgstr ""
"अत्र भवन्तः सहभागिनां क्रीडकानां संख्यां परिवर्तयितुं शक्नुवन्ति, तथैव "
"कृत्रिमबुद्ध्या कः क्रीडितः भविष्यति इति निर्धारयितुं शक्नुवन्ति । "
"प्रतिभागिनां संख्यां निर्दिष्टुं <guilabel>क्रीडकानां संख्या:</guilabel> "
"स्पिन-बॉक्सस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु । ततः प्रत्येकस्य प्रतिभागिनः नाम टङ्कयन्तु "
"तथा च खिलाडीप्रकारं निर्दिष्टुं <guilabel>Human?</guilabel> चेकबॉक्सस्य "
"उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:224
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Board"
msgstr "गेम बोर्ड"

#: index.docbook:225
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can regulate the size of the game board. Use the "
"<guilabel>Width:</guilabel> and <guilabel>Height:</guilabel> spin-boxes to "
"change the width and height of the game board."
msgstr ""
"अत्र भवन्तः क्रीडाफलकस्य आकारं नियन्त्रयितुं शक्नुवन्ति । क्रीडाफलकस्य "
"विस्तारं ऊर्ध्वतां च परिवर्तयितुं <guilabel>Width:</guilabel> तथा "
"<guilabel>Height:</guilabel> स्पिन-बॉक्स् इत्यस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:228
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Game Settings"
msgstr "गेम सेटिंग्स्"

#: index.docbook:229
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This part of the configuration dialog regulates the difficulty of the game. "
"If you leave the <guilabel>Quick start</guilabel> check box unchecked - the "
"game will begin with the empty grid. Otherwise the game will start with the "
"game board partially filled."
msgstr ""
"विन्याससंवादस्य एषः भागः क्रीडायाः कठिनतां नियन्त्रयति । यदि भवान् "
"<guilabel>शीघ्रप्रारम्भ</guilabel> इति चेकबॉक्सं अनिर्दिष्टं त्यजति - तर्हि "
"क्रीडा रिक्तजालेन आरभ्यते । अन्यथा क्रीडाफलकं आंशिकरूपेण पूरितं कृत्वा "
"आरभ्यते।"

#: index.docbook:234
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration Dialog"
msgstr "विन्याससंवादः"

#: index.docbook:241
#. Tag: phrase
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configuration dialog"
msgstr "विन्याससंवादः"

#: index.docbook:245
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Configure - &ksquares;</guilabel> dialog consists of the "
"following tabs:"
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Configure - &ksquares;</guilabel> संवादे निम्नलिखित ट्याब्स् "
"सन्ति ।"

#: index.docbook:248
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Display"
msgstr "प्रदर्शन"

#: index.docbook:249
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Here you can change the &ksquares; color settings."
msgstr "अत्र भवन्तः &ksquares; वर्णसेटिंग्स्।"

#: index.docbook:252
#. Tag: guilabel
#, no-c-format
msgid "Computer Player"
msgstr "कम्प्यूटर प्लेयर"

#: index.docbook:253
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use this tab to regulate the game difficulty."
msgstr "क्रीडायाः कठिनतां नियन्त्रयितुं एतस्य ट्याब् इत्यस्य उपयोगं कुर्वन्तु ।"

